#chip 16F886

'Demonstrates that Change1646's fix is general, not UBound-specific: any
'function-call initializer in a combined "Dim x As Type = expr" statement hit the
'same bug (Abs() shown here). result is used afterwards so the assignment isn't
'optimised away as dead code.

Dim result As Byte = Abs(-5)

Do Forever
  PulseOut PortB.5, result ms
  Wait 900 ms
Loop
